&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:10pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;都立広尾病院 研修医&lt;/p&gt;
